{"id":"wb-8-362","name":"龙泉澧河石桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"龙泉澧河石桥","text":"龙泉澧河石桥，又名翠花桥，位于中华人民共和国河南省平顶山市叶县龙泉乡龙泉村，横跨于澧河之上，是一座始建于明代的石梁桥。该桥是南北走向，现长64.75米，宽3.2米，高1.96米，共有33孔32个桥墩。桥体采用石板平铺结构，并使用铁制腰铁和插铁加强整体稳固性。桥墩西侧雕有螭首，东侧对应螭尾，兼具分水减冲和装饰功能。该桥历史上曾是南北交通要冲，直至1981年西侧新建钢筋混凝土大桥后，其交通功能才被取代。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%BE%99%E6%B3%89%E6%BE%A7%E6%B2%B3%E7%9F%B3%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":94557036,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94557036","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8f90ec30a1b101572dc534e1.jpg","title":"20260903_Longquan_Li_River_Stone_Bridge_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260903_Longquan_Li_River_Stone_Bridge_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/89/20260903_Longquan_Li_River_Stone_Bridge_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 河南叶县 龙泉澧河石桥","width":320,"height":213}}